    "description" : "Payments across all rails, standing orders, direct debits, P2P and bill pay. Publishes payment.events to Kafka via the outbox. Generated from the service's controllers. Set {{baseUrl}} to the gateway (http://localhost:8080) to go through the edge instead of hitting the service directly. Authorization is disabled by default: enable it and set {{accessToken}} once gateway.security.enabled=true.",
